<img alt="Son of Galleon's Saddle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mushanbeastmount.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Son of Galleon's Saddle</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a> is notable in that it drops item level 496 Tier 14 Legs and Gloves, as well as various item level 483 Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a headstart on your Tier set if you get lucky. <br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90910/mindfire-sollerets">
<img alt="Mindfire Sollerets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mindfire Sollerets</span></a>, a decent pair of early Boots. Not to mention a chance at the very rare <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87771/reins-of-the-heavenly-onyx-cloud-serpent">
<img alt="Reins of the Heavenly Onyx Cloud Serpent" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pandarenserpentgodmount_black.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reins of the Heavenly Onyx Cloud Serpent</span></a>.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Protection Warrior</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. As a <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warrior.gif");'></span>
<span class="c1">Protection Warrior</span>, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1337/the-klaxxi">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Klaxxi</span></a> and <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1269/golden-lotus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a> to get your hands on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90860/seal-of-the-unscathed">
<img alt="Seal of the Unscathed" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_146.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of the Unscathed</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90594/durable-necklace-of-the-golden-lotus">
<img alt="Durable Necklace of the Golden Lotus" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_107.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Durable Necklace of the Golden Lotus</span></a> at <span class="rep-exalted">Exalted</span>. <br/>
<br/>Depending on where in the phase you are, it may be worth looking at factions where you have limited gear available from Mogu'shan Vault, like the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> helmet from <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1270/shado-pan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan</span></a> as you likely won't be prioritized for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87024/nullification-greathelm">
<img alt="Nullification Greathelm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_plate_raidwarrior_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nullification Greathelm</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-klaxxi">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
